Error [E0417]: `priv` and `pub` can't both apply to one item
  --> tests/ui/pub_file_pub_priv_conflict.jet:3:1
    |
  3 | priv pub fn secret() => Int :: 0
    | ^^^^^^^^
 Why: an item is either public or private — pick one qualifier
 Fix: drop `pub` (already public in a `#PubFile` file) or remove `priv`

Error [E0113]: `run` promises to return Unit ? Err, but this `return` is empty
  --> tests/ui/pub_file_pub_priv_conflict.jet:5:5
    |
  5 |     return
    |     ^^^^^^
 Why: the value handed back must match the type after `=>`
 Fix: add the value: `return ...;`
